  "body": "## What changed\n\nRegenerate `examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.camproj` with the existing integration test.\nOnly the version field changes, from 70 to 71.\nAdd `the_committed_project_uses_the_current_file_version` to identify a stale version directly.\nRecord the decision in `docs/decisions/2651-continuous-project.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nPR #2134 raised `PROJECT_VERSION` to 71.\nThe example still used version 70.\nThe existing test correctly rejected the stale project.\n\n## Tests\n\n- New pin: `the_committed_project_uses_the_current_file_version` failed before the fix with 70 != 71.\n- Existing pin: `the_continuous_4axis_part_posts_its_wrapped_program` failed before the fix with `/version: 71 != 70`.\n- Mutation: restore the fixture from `upstream/main`. The new pin fails. Restore the regenerated fixture. The pin passes.\n- `cargo test -j 6 -p camcraft-app --test continuous_4axis_part`: all 10 tests pass.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green.\n- `cargo clippy -j 6 -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green.\n- `git diff --check`: clean.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nOne project fixture changes its version field.\nNo `.nc` or `.cl` files change.\nThe regenerated NC file is byte-identical.\nIts SHA-256 remains `5e27be6ad4976b2df42031025c53592571ec7e42729d7c5f3b3132ac6b2678b6`.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo full workspace, batch, release, GUI, or hardware tests ran.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n#2563 changes the same project version line.\nThe maintainer explicitly accepted this overlap on #2651 and directed a branch from main.\nThis PR does not stack on #2563.\n#2563 also touches the same test file, different function (`build_with`); whichever merges second refreshes.\nThe new pin is a separate function.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2651\n",
